# Skill Route gate

- MUST match the bound graph first (open-repo `SKG_repo` / `.cursor/skills/skill-graph-seed.wire` if present, else pack `SKG_global` / `SKILL-GRAPH.md`), in at most 2 passes; use `~/.cursor/skills/LLM.md` secondarily.
- MUST NOT glob every `SKILL.md`; open and follow one matched skill.
- For SysML, MUST use `sysml-modeling-session-checklist` -> `sysml-modeling-workflow` -> <=1 `sysml-*` specialist.
- MUST honour open-repo `AGENTS.md`; after two ambiguous scans, ask user or read it.
- MUST prefer MCP before bulk file reads and lazy-load skill references, assets, and tools.
- MUST verify with commands that produce sane proof. Project architecture belongs in repo Project Rules.

